<https://w3id.org/occo#hasBaseline> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a performance outcome to a reference baseline outcome against which it is compared. This property is directional: the subject is the measured outcome, the object is the baseline."@en .
